0.\\nDixonReconstruct[{real, imag}, echo, {b0}] reconstructs Dixon data with \
intitial guess T2star = 0.\\nDixonReconstruct[{real, imag}, echo, {b0, t2}] \
reconstructs Dixon data with t2star and B0.\\nDixonReconstruct[{real, imag}, \
echo, {b0, t2, ph0}] reconstructs Dixon data with initial \
phase.\\nDixonReconstruct[{real, imag}, echo, {b0, t2, ph0, phb}] \
reconstructs Dixon data with bipolar phase .\\n\\nOutput is \
{{watF,fatF},{watSig,fatSig},{inphase,outphase},{{b0, ph0, phb},{r2, \
t2}},itterations}.\\n\\nThe fractions are between 0 and 1, the B0 field map \
is in Hz and the T2start map is in ms.\\n\\nDixonReconstruct[] is based on \
DOI: 10.1002/mrm.20624 and 10.1002/mrm.21737 (10.1002/nbm.3766).\"\>", 
