         {
          ItemBox[
           PaneBox[
            
            StyleBox["\<\"RegisterTensorData[target, moving] registers the \
moving tensor to the target tensor. After registration the tensor is \
reorinented apropriately. \\nThe inputs target and moving can be in the \
forms: tensor, {tensor, vox}, {tensor, mask} or {tensor, mask, \
vox}.\\nRegisterTensorData[target, moving, tensor] registers the moving data \
to the target data and apllies the deformation to the tensor. \\nThe inputs \
target and moving can be in the form: data, {data, vox}, {data, mask} or \
{data, mask, vox}.\\nThe input tensor can be in the form: tensor or {tensor, \
vox}.\\n\\nonly \\\"rigid\\\", \\\"affine\\\" and \\\"bspline\\\" can be used \
as MetReg.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
             StripOnInput->False,
             LineSpacing->{1.5, 1.5, 3.}],
