t22 the \\\"fluid\\\" relaxation times.\\n\\nThe te and tr as well as the \
relaxation times T2 and T1 can be defines in any time unit as long as they \
are consistant for all, e.g. all in ms.\\n\\noutput is the corrected fraction \
maps.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
