1D ,2D, 3D or 4D. \nbinp should be full bmatrix which can be calculated from \
the bvecs en bvals using Bmatrix with the bvalues in s/mm^2. \ninit should \
are the initialization parameters for 2 components this is {s0, f, D, Dp} for \
3 componentes this is {s0, f1, f2, D, Dp1, Dp2}.\n\nThe fraction is defined \
between 0 and 1, the D, Dp, Dp1 and Dp2 is in mm^2/s.\n\noutput is {s0, f1, \
D, pD1} or {s0, f1, f2, D, pD1, pD2}.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/IVIMCalc"|>, 
    "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None, "DownValues" -> None, 
    "SubValues" -> None, "DefaultValues" -> 
    Information`InformationValueForm[
     DefaultValues, QMRITools`IVIMTools`IVIMCalc, {
      SyntaxInformation[QMRITools`IVIMTools`IVIMCalc] -> {"ArgumentsPattern" -> {
           Blank[], 
           Blank[], 
           Blank[], 
           Optional[
            Blank[]], 
           OptionsPattern[]}}}], "NValues" -> None, "FormatValues" -> None, 
    "Options" -> {
     Method -> Automatic, Parallelize -> True, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`MonitorIVIMCalc -> True, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`IVIMFixed -> False, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`IVIMConstrained -> True, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`IVIMTensFit -> False, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`IVIMComponents -> 2, 
      QMRITools`IVIMTools`IVIMConstrains -> {{0.8, 1.2}, {0, 1}, {0.0005, 
        0.0035}, {0.001, 0.5}, {0.001, 0.5}}}, 
    "Attributes" -> {Protected, ReadProtected}, "FullName" -> 
    "QMRITools`IVIMTools`IVIMCalc"|>, True]]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.900559766820182*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[173]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a9c7a622-6624-4fc9-bbf8-975bd5ff54fc"],

